sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant W as Waybar
    actor A as Admin
    participant L as Logger
    U->>W: click clock
    W->>Hyprlnd: dispatch workspace
    loop every second
        W-->>U: redraw
    end
    alt battery low
        W->>U: warn
    else charging
        W->>U: show icon
    end
    Note over U,W: all local
    activate W
    deactivate W
